   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"cluster-overview\">\n<p class=\"lead\">Das Ethernet-Cluster realisiert IP-basierte Fahrzeugvernetzung, BroadR-Reach/100BASE-T1 Kommunikation, TCP/UDP-Stacks, IPv4/IPv6-Adressierung und Service-orientierte Schnittstellen.</p>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"sect\">Module im Cluster</h2>\n<div class=\"cards\">\n  <a class=\"card\" href=\"modules/eth.html\">\n    <h3>Ethernet Driver (Eth)</h3>\n    <p>Provides uniform hardware access to Ethernet controller interfaces.</p>\n    <div class=\"card-meta\">\n      <span class=\"chip\">BSW ID 88</span>\n      <span class=\"chip\">42 APIs (24 Funktionen, 18 Typen)</span>\n      <span class=\"chip\"><code>#include &quot;Eth.h&quot;</code></span>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n  <a class=\"card\" href=\"modules/ethif.html\">\n    <h3>Ethernet Interface (EthIf)</h3>\n    <p>Abstracts Ethernet controller and transceiver hardware for upper protocol layers.</p>\n    <div class=\"card-meta\">\n      <span class=\"chip\">BSW ID 65</span>\n      <span class=\"chip\">92 APIs (88 Funktionen, 4 Typen)</span>\n      <span class=\"chip\"><code>#include &quot;EthIf.h&quot;</code></span>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n  <a class=\"card\" href=\"modules/tcpip.html\">\n    <h3>TCP/IP Stack (TcpIp)</h3>\n    <p>Provides IPv4/IPv6 networking, TCP/UDP sockets, ARP, ICMP, and DHCP services.</p>\n    <div class=\"card-meta\">\n      <span class=\"chip\">BSW ID 170</span>\n      <span class=\"chip\">64 APIs (42 Funktionen, 22 Typen)</span>\n      <span class=\"chip\"><code>#include &quot;TcpIp.h&quot;</code></span>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n</div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  }
